cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ResistoMeta in your research, please cite it as below."

title: "ResistoMeta: A modular and reproducible pipeline for metagenomic antimicrobial resistance characterization"
version: "1.0.0"
type: software

abstract: >
  ResistoMeta is a modular and reproducible metagenomic antimicrobial
  resistance analysis pipeline integrating quality control, host depletion,
  taxonomic profiling, read-based antimicrobial resistance gene detection,
  metagenome assembly, assembly quality assessment, contig-level resistance
  annotation, plasmid replicon detection, and downstream resistome, taxonomy,
  and plasmid analyses.

